IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. TEST-EVAL.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-VAR PIC 9 VALUE 3.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EVALUATE WS-VAR
        WHEN 3
            DISPLAY "VALUE MATCHES 3"
        WHEN OTHER
            DISPLAY "VALUE DOES NOT MATCH 3"
    END-EVALUATE.
    STOP RUN.